{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_04_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_04",
  "title": "機獸咆哮",
  "storyCode": "RI-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9570ca5dd878bf40ae71ee8c299b16469f2aa900931954966a4bddccce8e99b3",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯嘍囉A",
      "text": "嘎哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯嘍囉B",
      "text": "太、太強了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏代",
      "text": "算你厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "text": "森蚺，別得意！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿魯納",
      "text": "小的們，上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "森蚺",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "唔，不愧是祖瑪瑪，果然很厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "雖然只有一個人，一般的阿達克利斯也不是她的對手，就像嘉維爾一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好像很熟悉她。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嗯，祖瑪瑪和嘉維爾從前開始就是我們這一帶最厲害的兩個人呢。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "不過據我所知，祖瑪瑪從來沒有贏過嘉維爾哦！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "博士。在外面這麼厲害的人一定很少見吧！",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "但是，嘉維爾更厲害哦！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "好帥的女孩子。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "唔，雖然祖瑪瑪確實很帥。",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "但是，嘉維爾更帥！",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "對吧，嘉維爾？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "咦，嘉維爾呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
          "text": "喂，你們看，那個人是！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
          "text": "我剛才在來的路上就看到了，她是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人C",
          "text": "她居然真的回來了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你是——",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "所有人",
          "text": "嘉維爾！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "哇啊啊啊啊，嘉維爾直接衝上台了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "好久不見啊，祖瑪瑪！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "現在應該叫你森蚺頭領了對吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你居然回來了，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "是啊，特米米叫我回來的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嗯？等等，你居然也會說薩爾貢語？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......既然你也會這種語言，看來這種語言確實是外面的語言沒錯。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我學習了很久。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......我以為你不會再回來了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "我會回來的，不是現在，未來也會回來的，這裡是我的家。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......你要當大酋長？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "不，本來我只是找你有點事，打完再找你也沒關係的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "但是，你這傢伙變得這麼厲害了，這讓我怎麼忍得住啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你真的去做醫生了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "是啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘿，我在外面可是很有名的醫生！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "真意外。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你呢，上次的時候你不是在搗鼓自己的東西沒有參加嗎？終於搗鼓好了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......是。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你馬上就會見到。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特米米",
          "text": "嗚嗚嗚，嘉維爾不是說她不會出手的嗎......",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉維爾出乎你的意料了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "誒？沒、沒有的事！只、只是.......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "博士也看入迷了......",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嗚嗚，雖然確實很帥，但是......",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "這才是嘉維爾。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "text": "嗚嗚，雖然這麼說是沒錯。",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......你還是那麼強，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "嘿，你也不差啊，祖瑪瑪！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，你太依賴你的拳頭了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你的拳頭讓你可以做到許多事，所以你從不考慮用拳頭以外的東西做事。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "這是你的局限性，也是我們這些人的局限性。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "你到底在說什麼？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "我在說，該改變了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "隨著“嘿咻”，“嘿咻”整齊的喊聲，林間似乎有什麼龐然大物在靠近神廟。\n它緩慢，而又堅實地“走”著，還不見其全貌，就已經讓人感覺它無堅不摧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你確實很強，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "原本，我是想在成為大酋長後再用它的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "現在，我不得不用它來對付你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，結果是一樣的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "它將改變這裡。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "雖然不知道你在說什麼，不過我可沒那麼輕易倒下啊！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "不，你會輕易地倒下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "......大祭司，瞄準，開炮！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
          "text": "什麼，那是？！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "你看，我說了，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "但是，用它對付你，並不是我本來的目的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "靠拳頭是沒有未來的，嘉維爾。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "森蚺",
          "text": "接下來，是機器的時代。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
